 {"id":"poi:weekend:nanxun-library","parentId":"weekend-city-huzhou","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"湖州","name":"南浔古镇 · 嘉业藏书楼与小莲庄","category":"culture","placeKind":"ancient_town","whyGo":"从藏书楼认识南浔。嘉业藏书楼的回廊与砖木空间，能引出一个具体问题，一座建筑怎样让书籍通风、防潮并避火。再沿古镇街河步行，把藏书文化放回江南生活。","experience":"先了解嘉业藏书楼与刘承幹的关系，再观察临河街巷和园林空间。具体建筑是否开放进入，以现场安排为准。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日，跨城往返另计","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"嘉业堂藏书楼","authority":"中国全民阅读网","url":"https://www.nationalreading.gov.cn/ydkj/dmsg/202405/t20240506_845945_m.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"ancient_town","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:wuzhen","parentId":"weekend-city-jiaxing","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"嘉兴","name":"乌镇古镇旅游区","category":"culture","placeKind":"ancient_town","whyGo":"观察水乡的生活空间，比只看一座桥更有意思。乌镇的水阁、廊棚、老街与河道连在一起，适合沿着街河慢慢理解建筑怎样适应临水生活。","experience":"按实际时间选择东栅或西栅一段路线，不把两个片区和所有表演都塞进一日。年度戏剧节另按正式日期安排。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议1至2日，跨城往返另计","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"乌镇古镇旅游区","authority":"文化和旅游部","url":"https://sjfw.mct.gov.cn/site/dataservice/culdetails?curId=10&id=34882","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"ancient_town","originPlans":{"杭州":2,"上海":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:anchang","parentId":"weekend-city-shaoxing","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"绍兴","name":"安昌古镇 · 老台门","category":"culture","placeKind":"ancient_town","whyGo":"安昌值得细看的是临河生活与老台门。沿河街留意天井、砖雕门罩和堂名，会发现看似相近的门面，背后连接着不同的家庭空间。","experience":"以公共街巷与开放区域为主，比较街、河与门庭的位置，不推定所有老台门内部都可参观。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日，往返另计","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"古镇安昌老台门","authority":"柯桥区人大","url":"https://wz.kq.gov.cn/art/2014/8/15/art_1604984_28807925.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"ancient_town","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:luxun-hometown","parentId":"weekend-city-shaoxing","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"绍兴","name":"鲁迅故里 · 鲁迅纪念馆","category":"culture","placeKind":"historic_district","whyGo":"读过鲁迅，再看绍兴的生活空间，会有更具体的参照。故居、祖居与三味书屋，让人物的成长经历与真实建筑发生联系；文学情节仍应与史实分开理解。","experience":"选择与自己读过的作品有关的几个空间，留时间看纪念馆，而非只在街口停留。具体预约与参观入口按当期要求确认。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议1日，跨城往返另计","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"鲁迅纪念馆介绍","authority":"绍兴市官方平台","url":"https://sxlz.sx.gov.cn/art/2022/11/14/art_1229701440_58924111.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"culture","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:liangzhu-museum","parentId":"weekend-city-hangzhou","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"杭州","name":"良渚博物院 · 基本陈列","category":"culture","placeKind":"museum","whyGo":"从考古材料认识良渚，比记住一个年代更具体。水乡泽国、文明圣地、玉魂国魄三个展厅，把聚落环境、社会生活和玉器放在同一段文明背景里。","experience":"围绕一类感兴趣的文物看展，再对照不同展厅的解释。博物院与良渚古城遗址公园是不同入口，不混作同一个参观点。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"良渚博物院简介","authority":"良渚博物院","url":"https://www.lzmuseum.cn/class/BoWuYuanJianJie/index.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"},{"title":"参观须知","authority":"良渚博物院","url":"https://www.lzmuseum.cn/ZuiXinGongGao/2024934396935.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"museum","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"closedWeekdays":[1],"holidayExceptions":true,"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:silk-roads","parentId":"weekend-city-hangzhou","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"杭州","name":"中国丝绸博物馆 · 锦程","category":"culture","placeKind":"long_term_exhibition","whyGo":"从一件织物追问它怎样传播。锦程：中国丝绸与丝绸之路通过织物、技术与沿线交流，帮助理解丝绸怎样连接不同地方的生活。","experience":"先选一个感兴趣的展览单元，留意材料、图案与技术的关系。官网将其列为长期展，并给出截止日期，不能视作永久展。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"event","start":"2016-09-05","end":"2028-03-01"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"锦程：中国丝绸与丝绸之路","authority":"中国丝绸博物馆","url":"https://www.chinasilkmuseum.com/zz/info_17.aspx?itemid=26320","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"museum","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:tea-shuangfeng","parentId":"weekend-city-hangzhou","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"杭州","name":"中国茶叶博物馆 · 双峰馆区","category":"culture","placeKind":"museum","whyGo":"把茶园与展览放在同一天。双峰馆区的常设内容介绍中华茶文化、西湖龙井与茶具，可以带着喝茶时的问题，在展厅里寻找材料与解释。","experience":"本条以龙井路88号的双峰馆区为单一入口，不与龙井馆区混淆。馆方指南列周二闭馆，节假日与临时公告另查。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"参观指南与馆区介绍","authority":"中国茶叶博物馆","url":"https://www.teamuseum.cn/mobile/basicIntroduction.htm","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"museum","originPlans":{"杭州":1,"上海":2},"closedWeekdays":[2],"holidayExceptions":true,"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:shanghai-bronzes","parentId":"weekend-city-shanghai","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"上海","city":"上海","name":"上海博物馆东馆 · 中国古代青铜馆","category":"culture","placeKind":"museum","whyGo":"从器物的形制与制作技术认识古代生活。青铜馆的通史陈列把年代、工艺与艺术放在一起，适合为几件感兴趣的器物留出仔细观看的时间。","experience":"先理解器物用途，再看制作技术的展示。本条指浦东东馆的青铜陈列，不能把旧试开放公告的预约名额当成当前状态。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议半日至1日","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"东馆中国古代青铜馆陈列介绍","authority":"上海博物馆","url":"https://www.shanghaimuseum.net/mu/frontend/pg/article/id/I00004625","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"museum","originPlans":{"上海":1,"杭州":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:zhujiajian","parentId":"weekend-city-zhoushan","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"舟山","name":"朱家尖岛 · 海岸体验","category":"nature","placeKind":"island","whyGo":"把海岸步行作为一趟短旅行的主题。朱家尖可通过大桥陆路进入，安排本岛体验时不必额外增加跨海船渡，但旺季堵车与岛内移动仍要留时间。","experience":"本条只指朱家尖本岛。前往普陀山、东极等地是另外的船渡线路，不能一起当作轻松两日的默认安排。海边活动随天气与开放条件选择。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议2日，交通条件确认后安排","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"conditional"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"朱家尖交通调研","authority":"舟山市政协","url":"https://zszx.zhoushan.gov.cn/art/2022/4/24/art_1228991371_58898737.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"island","originPlans":{"杭州":2,"上海":2},"conditionalTransport":true,"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:daishan","parentId":"weekend-city-zhoushan","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"浙江","city":"舟山","name":"岱山岛 · 本岛海岸","category":"nature","placeKind":"island","whyGo":"舟岱大桥改变了进入岱山本岛的陆路条件，可以把海岛生活与海岸环境作为两日旅行的线索。先围绕本岛选择路线，再考虑是否延伸其他岛屿。","experience":"这是岱山本岛区域候选，不表示县域内所有岛都能开车到达，也不把尚未核对运营的具体海岸项目列成已确认活动。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议2日，交通条件确认后安排","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"conditional"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"舟岱大桥通车","authority":"财政部官网转载人民日报","url":"https://jx.mof.gov.cn/zt/jgdj/xxjl/202112/t20211231_3780201.htm","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"island","originPlans":{"杭州":2,"上海":2},"conditionalTransport":true,"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:chongming","parentId":"weekend-city-shanghai","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"上海","city":"上海","name":"崇明岛 · 乡村与江岸","category":"mixed","placeKind":"estuary_island","whyGo":"崇明是长江口的冲积岛，可以从江海环境、乡村生活、山歌与土布认识它。挑一条实际开放的江岸或乡村路线，比把整座岛当成一个小景区更合适。","experience":"选择公路桥隧方案时不以船渡为前提。不能把调试中的轨道线路写成已运营，也不将保护区核心区当作可以自由进入的普通公园。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议1至2日，具体路线另定","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"conditional"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"崇明区介绍","authority":"上海市人民政府","url":"https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/chongming/index.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"island","originPlans":{"上海":2,"杭州":2},"conditionalTransport":true,"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}},
 {"id":"poi:weekend:zhujiajiao","parentId":"weekend-city-shanghai","country":"中国","regionCode":"CN","province":"上海","city":"上海","name":"朱家角古镇","category":"culture","placeKind":"ancient_town","whyGo":"沿街巷、水网与古桥理解江南古镇。放生桥与课植园等空间适合细看，游船是可选体验，不必为了把项目排满而赶路。","experience":"官方指南列地铁17号线朱家角站等到达方式，车站到古镇仍有最后接驳。实际开放、车次与返程按出行日确认。","durationEstimate":"编辑建议1日，跨城往返另计","durationKind":"editorial","seasonality":{"mode":"year_round"},"recordKind":"official-weekend-experience","checkedAt":"2026-10-29","sources":[{"title":"朱家角古镇介绍","authority":"上海市人民政府","url":"https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/fygz/20260625/09beddb4cff345ba80b159c409cad101.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"},{"title":"青浦文旅出行指南","authority":"上海市人民政府","url":"https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw17239/20250106/efc9d864d3dc4a27a802cccd3afb7712.html","accessLevel":"body-verified","accessedAt":"2026-10-29"}],"weekend":{"type":"ancient_town","originPlans":{"上海":1,"杭州":2},"requiresFerry":false,"transportVerified":false,"doorToDoorHours":null}}
]
